<a href =""https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LinearRegression.html"">https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LinearRegression.html</a>
<p>Refer to the following link for performance metrics for regression</p>
<a href= ""https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/model_evaluation.html"">https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/model_evaluation.html</a>

