Free online courses and online internship opportunities to the winners!
Certificate of appreciation.

Certificate of Participation will be provided to all the participants
----------------------
# Evaluation

Submissions will be evaluated on the Area under the Receiver Operating Characteristic (ROC) curve between the index and the target.

Learn more about AUC in this [developer crash course](https://developers.google.com/machine-learning/crash-course/classification/roc-and-auc), [this video](https://www.dataschool.io/roc-curves-and-auc-explained/), or [this Kaggle Learn Forum post](https://www.kaggle.com/learn-forum/53782).

