#Prizes

This Kaggle [competition](https://www.kaggle.com/docs/competitions#common-competition-types) does not have prizes itself.

The participants also submitting to the Robust Vision Challenge, are eligible for [the prizes of that challenge](http://www.robustvision.net/).","# Dataset Description

The train and validation sets of images and their ground truth (bounding boxes and labels) should be downloaded from [Open Images Challenge page](https://storage.googleapis.com/openimages/web/challenge_overview.html).  Please note that the test images used in this competition is independent from those released as part of the [Open Images Dataset](https://storage.googleapis.com/openimages/web/download.html). The images can be downloaded from:

* Kaggle (test.zip file below) 
* [CVDF](https://github.com/cvdfoundation/open-images-dataset)
* [Figure 8](https://www.figure-eight.com/dataset/open-images-annotated-with-bounding-boxes/)

You should expect 99,999 images in total in the test set.

For each image in the test set, you must predict a list of boxes describing objects in the image. Each box is described as 

    ImageID,PredictionString
    ImageID,{Label Confidence XMin YMin XMax YMax} {...}",True,True
