4872,idl-fall21-hw2p2s2-face-verification-slack,"# Description

This is part 2 Face verification for HW2P2. In addition to this, you should also finish part 1 Face classification.

In part 2 Face verification, you will use Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) to design an end-to-end system for face verification. Your system will be given two images as input and will output a score that quantifies the similarity between the faces in these images. This helps us decide whether the faces from the two images are of the same person or not.

You can build on your face classification model, or use other methods like Siamese Networks. Read the writeup for more hints.
