<td>C = Cherbourg, Q = Queenstown, S = Southampton</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2 id=""notas"">Notas</h2>
<p><strong>pclass</strong>: Un indicador aproximado de la situaci&oacute;n socioecon&oacute;mica (SES)</p>
<ul>
<li>1st = Upper</li>
<li>2nd = Middle</li>
<li>3rd = Lower</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>age</strong>: Age is fractional if less than 1. If the age is estimated, is it in the form of xx.5</p>
<p><strong>sibsp</strong>: El conjunto de datos define las relaciones familiares de esta manera...</p>
<ul>
<li>Sibling = hermano, hermana, hermanastro, hermanastra, hermanastra, ...</li>
<li>Spouse = marido, esposa (las amantes y los prometidos son ignorados)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>parch</strong>: El conjunto de datos define las relaciones familiares de esta manera...</p>
<ul>
<li>Parent = madre, padre</li>
<li>Child = hija, hijo, hijastra, hijastro, hijastro</li>
</ul>
<p>Algunos ni&ntilde;os viajaban s&oacute;lo con una ni&ntilde;era, por lo tanto parch=0 para ellos.</p>",True,True
4880,profitrain1,"# Description

A serious problem arising in the early stages of development of oil and gas fields is the insufficient amount of information about the parameters of these fields. Incorrectly estimated parameters threaten with large errors in assessing the underlying volumes of oil and gas, which brings economic losses to the company that develops the field.

A particularly important parameter is the location of the oil field.

P.s.: This challenge and data was presented at the I-Professional Olympiad in 2021.
