# Evaluation

The evaluation metric for this competition is [Accuracy](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Accuracy_and_precision).

## Submission Format

**For every answer in the dataset**, submission files should contain two columns: `Index` and `Onshore/Offshore`. 

The file should contain a header and have the following format:
```
Index,Onshore/Offshore
1, ONSHORE
```

