The initial version of the Armenian handwritten letters dataset - Mashtots dataset was created in the Basic Research Laboratory of ""Automation Systems & Modeling"" of the National Polytechnic University of Armenia. Further additions and corrections were made at the Science and Technology Foundation of Armenia (FAST).
For dataset creation, we have asked more than 1,000 people to complete this [form] (https://mashtots.org/MASHTOTS.pdf), after which the corresponding letters were separated, then they were carefully examined, the letters containing inaccuracies were removed from the collection.
However, the initial version of the dataset could contain some errors and mistakes, we will be grateful for informing us about the noticed errors and mistakes.
If you have any questions, write to davitg@fast.foundation .


