*   **test.csv** - the test set
*   **sample_submission.csv** - a sample submission file in the correct format

## Columns

*   `Label` - Either `Happy` or `Sad`
*   `Filename`",True,True
5016,code-ml-2021-challenge-2,"# Description

# Code ML 2021 Challenge 2 (easy)

[francais plus bas]

## Solve the maze with RL

This challenge is a Reinforcement learning challenge, using a custom OpenAI gym environment.

- Difficulty : Easy

## Overview 

The aim is to solve a custom maze using a simple reinforcement learning algorithm. 

It would enable you to learn more about Reinforcement Learning, OpenAI gym environment, and to understand better how to improve the classic RL algorithms.

### Data description

There is no dataset, but an environment provided for this challenge. 

You will be able to play with the environment and then implement an algorithm to make the convergence process as fast as possible. 

To start the challenge, please use this notebook : 

https://colab.research.google.com/drive/17zBS_STZJyBrnN9lfXYp9qyCEiZ3TAFA?usp=sharing

It provides you the code and advises to start the challenge, such as the format of the submission.


## Submission 

You are asked to send us your code. We will then evaluate it and give a score. Please follow the format provided in the notebook.

## Evaluation 

The evaluation will be the average number of steps to make your algorithm converged. You would have 1000 episodes to play with the environment and make your algorithm converge. Once you have solved more than 50 times the maze, the number of episodes to get to this will be your score. 

Get the best score to win the competition. 

You should send either the notebook filled or the cell to be completed in the following mail address :  **codemlmaze@gmail.com** with subject [Submission Code ML - TEAM NAME ]. 

You have 3 submissions per day. 

The results will be shown in the discord channel. 


## Help 

Feel free to ask questions to Cl¨¦ment Bernard in the discord channel if you have any question or problem.

# [FRANCAIS]

## R¨¦soudre le labyrinthe avec de l'apprentissage par renforcement

Cette tache est un challenge d'apprentissage par renforcement utilisant un environnement du style d'OpenAI gym. 

- Difficult¨¦ : Facile

## Vue d'ensemble

Le but est de r¨¦soudre un labyrinthe avec un algorithme d'apprentissage par renforcement.

Cela vous permettra d'en apprendre plus sur de l'apprentissage par renforcement, les API d'OpenAI gym, et de chercher comment am¨¦liorer les algorithmes de base d'apprentissage par renforcement.

### Description des donn¨¦es

Il n'y a pas de donn¨¦es, mais un environnement pour ce challenge.

Vous pourrez interagir avec l'environnement et ensuite impl¨¦menter un algorithme pour le faire converger aussi rapide que possible.

Pour commencer ce challenge, utilisez ce notebook : 

https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1ihHThKgndbipvR4zxB_QGVDcCmJOcKdW?usp=sharing

Cela fournit un code ainsi que des conseils pour commencer le challenge, ainsi que le format de la soumission.

## Soumission 

