## Dataset details

The training set contains the following two columns: 
* `text` - Concatenation of the post's title and description
* `subreddit` - Subreddit associated with the post

## Evaluation
We will score your submissions based on the mean F1-score

EXPECTED SUBMISSION FORMAT: the submission file must contain two columns: 'id', and 'subreddit'.  
* Subreddit must be a string corresponding to the name of the predicted subreddit.

## Rules
* You are NOT allowed to train you model on additional data
* You are NOT allowed to use pre-trained models
* You are allowed to submit up to 10 submission per day for this challenge


