* Prv_HealthCov: Percent of county residents with private health coverage alone (no public assistance) (b)

* Employ_PrvCov: Percent of county residents with employee-provided private health coverage (b)

* Gov_HealthCov: Percent of county residents with government-provided health coverage (b)

* Gov_HealthCov_Alone: Percent of county residents with government-provided health coverage alone (b)

* White_Residents: Percent of county residents who identify as White (b)

* Black_Residents: Percent of county residents who identify as Black (b)

