5178,bigdata-2022-part-classification,"# Description

# Part A, Text Classification

You will be given a training dateset with articles in 4 categories. The task is to train a classier and to predict a testing set.

# Hints

- Experiment with the preprocessing
- Try to reduce  the training time in order to do more experiments
- Sometimes the default parameters are not enough
- Even if it is an overkill, experiment with huggingface transformers
- Use  Google colab


----------------------
# Evaluation



# Submission File

The submission file should contain a header and have the following format:
```
Id,Predicted
1,Business
```
#  Evaluation

The evaluation metric is  Macro F1 score.","# Dataset Description

# Files

- train.csv: The dataset you need to use for training the model.
- test.csv: The articles you need to predict.
- sample.csv: Some sample submission",True,True
