## Columns
Feature Attribute Information: (4 dimensions)

*   sepal length in cm
*   sepal width in cm
*   petal length in cm
*   petal width in cm

Label Information:

*   0  -- Iris Setosa
*   1  -- Iris Versicolour
*   2  -- Iris Virginica",True,True
