### Swag prizes
- Swag prizes for top winners are sponsored by Google Developers 
- Maximum of top 3 teams will receive swags from Google Developers 
- The number of team members is limited to 3
- Scoring Metric: Accuracy + Bonus if you attended a NYTFUG meetup (including past events)
- One prize will be reserved for the highest-scoring individual/team who attended a NYTFUG meeting (including past events). Other prizes will then be awarded based on accuracy score irrespective of NYTFUG affiliation
