### Restrictions
Google doesn't support competitions in Crimea, North Korea, Quebec, and where prohibited by law. This program follows Google Coding Competitions Terms, for more details see: https://codingcompetitions.withgoogle.com/terms .

### The fine print
- Swag deliveries can be delayed in some regions due to COVID-19.
