5333,uts-advdsi-22-02-nba-career-prediction,"# Description

<p>In the National Basketball Association (NBA), a rookie is any player who has never played a game in the NBA until that year. At the end of the season the NBA awards the best rookie with the NBA Rookie of the Year Award.</p>
<p><img style=""float: right"" alt=""NBA Rookie"" src=""https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2020/10/reddish-morant-williamson-barrett-split-0819-784x441.jpg""></p>
<p>Moving to the NBA league is a big deal for any basketball player. Sport commentators and fans are very excited to follow the start of their careers and guess how they will perform in the future.</p>
<p>You are tasked to build a model that will predict if a rookie player will last at least 5 years in the league based on his stats.</p>
----------------------
# Evaluation

<p>Submissions are evaluated on <a href=""http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Receiver_operating_characteristic"">area under the ROC curve</a>&nbsp;between the predicted probability and the observed target.</p>


<h2>Submission Format</h2>
<p>For each <code>Id</code>&nbsp;in the test set, you must predict a probability for the <code> TARGET_5Yrs </code> variable. The file should contain a header and have the following format:</p>
<p>The file should contain a header and have the following format:</p>
<pre><code>Id,TARGET_5Yrs
1,0.1
2,0.9
3,0.2
etc.
</code></pre>","# Dataset Description

<p>Dataset for predicting if a NBA rookie player will last at least 5 years in the league based on its stats</p>

<h2>Summary</h2>
<p>Classification Exercise: Predict 5-Year Career Longevity for NBA Rookies</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>y = 0</strong> if career years played < 5</li>
<li><strong>y = 1</strong> if career years played >= 5</li>
</ul>

<h2>File descriptions</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>train.csv</strong> - the training set</li>
<li><strong>test.csv</strong> - the test set</li>
<li><strong>sampleSubmission.csv</strong> - a sample submission file in the correct format</li>
</ul>

<h2>Data fields</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Id_old</strong> - Previous Player Identifier</li>
<li><strong>Id</strong> - Player Identifier</li>
<li><strong>GP</strong> - Games Played</li>
<li><strong>MIN</strong> - Minutes Played</li>
<li><strong>PTS</strong> - Points Per Game</li>
<li><strong>FGM</strong> - Field Goals Made</li>
<li><strong>FGA</strong> - Field Goals Attempts</li>
<li><strong>FG%</strong> - Field Goals Percent</li>
<li><strong>3P Made</strong> - 3-Points Made</li>
<li><strong>3PA</strong> - 3-Points Attempts</li>
<li><strong>3P%</strong> - 3-Points Percent</li>
<li><strong>FTM</strong> - Free Throw Made</li>
<li><strong>FTA</strong> - Free Throw Attempts</li>
<li><strong>FT%</strong> - Free Throw Percent</li>
<li><strong>OREB</strong> - Offensive Rebounds</li>
<li><strong>DREB</strong> - Defensive Rebounds</li>
<li><strong>REB</strong> - Rebounds</li>
<li><strong>AST</strong> - Assists</li>
<li><strong>STL</strong> - Steals</li>
<li><strong>BLK</strong> - Blocks</li>
<li><strong>TOV</strong> - Turnovers</li>
<li><strong>TARGET_5Yrs</strong> - Outcome: 1 if career length >= 5 years, 0 otherwise</li>
</ul>",True,True
