To train your model you will use the train.csv file

After training your model, generate a **sample_submission.csv** by predicting the labels of genome sequences in the **test.csv** file.

Participants should be able to answer these types of questions after reading the data description:

## Files

*   **train.csv** - the training set
*   **test.csv** - the test set
*   **sample_submission.csv** - a sample submission file in the correct format

## Columns

*   `id` - sequence id
*   `genome_sequence`?- genome sequence
*   `species`?- the genome label, can be **Homo_sapiens** or **Gorilla_gorilla**",True,True
