# Evaluation

Submissions will be evaluated based on their [mean F1 score.](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/F1_score)

F1-Score is the harmonic mean of precision and recall values used for a classification problem where an imbalanced dataset is observed. The formula for F1-Score is as follows:

