We've put together a data science competition so that you can highlight your awesome skills and engage with the awesome community of data science professionals on Fiverr. We¡¯re asking you to look at the steps a new user takes on Fiverr before and during registration, and predict which of them will become spammers. 

To enter the competition, you must be a [registered seller on Fiverr](https://www.fiverr.com/start_selling?utm_source=press&utm_medium=brand-partnerships&utm_campaign=bm_ge-ww_an-kaggle-seller-acq) and follow the guidelines of the competition.


