Ans: The data is in CSV format

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What should I do once the training and testing is done?

Ans: Find the accuracy of your model using R2 score metric

## Files

*   **stock_train.csv** - the training set
*   **stock_test.csv** - the test set
*   **sample_submission.csv** - a sample submission file in the correct format

## Columns

¡ñ ID - The id value of that row
¡ñ open - the opening value of the stock
¡ñ close - the closing value of the stock
¡ñ high - the highest value the stock climbed to
¡ñ low - the lowest value the stock dropped to",True,True
