5596,scioly-task,"# Description

Welcome to the Machine Learning trial event at the 2022 Science Olympiad States Competition! You can find the rules for the event on the Scilympiad website. Your submissions is due before the first event of the tournament is run, which is 6:50AM Pacific time.

Please change your team name (which you change under the Team tab) to your team number. If you don't do this, you may not receive a score for the Pre-Tournament Task.


