ISODS thanks to all the voluntary work by committee members, and looks forward to the participation and contribution. We would like to thank all the authors who contributed their datasets to the competition tracks as well. 
----------------------
# Other Credits

We would like to thank Addison Howard and Laurie White at Google, who help during the setting-up phase. 
----------------------
# Paper Template

If your team is invited to submit a conference paper, [download the paper template PDSAI_Template.docx here](https://github.com/isods/templates)","# Dataset Description

The dataset provides customer reviews on fashion and beauty products and a 5 star rating reflecting overall customer satisfaction. The data was provided by Dr. Jianmo Ni at Google.

## Files

*   **review_train.tsv** - the training set in tsv format
*   **review_test_post.tsv** - the test set in tsv format
*   **sample_submission.csv** - a sample submission file in the correct format

## Columns

1. summary: review summary
2. review: review text
3. reviewer: reviewer id
4. product: product id
5. rating: review rating

Note that the id column in the solution submission is just the row number in the review_test_post.tsv file (the id of 1 is the first review, the id of 2 is the second review, etc.; the last id is 250997)",True,True
