*   `Column #2`?- Topic Name",True,True
5661,cat-and-dog-classification-harper2022,"# Description

Welcome! This is an in-class Kaggle competition for Harper's 2022 Machine Learning and Computer vision camp!
In this competition you are tasked to classify images as either containing a cat or a dog. Your model will return 0 if the image has a cat and 1 for if image has a dog.
A starter Kaggle Notebook and Google Colab notebook will be provided to you.
Good Luck!
----------------------
# Evaluation

The evaluation metric for this competition is [AUC](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Receiver_operating_characteristic) which is similar to accuracy. The closer to 1, the better your model!

## Submission Format

Submission files should contain two columns: `Id` and `Target`.

The file should contain a header and have the following format:
```
Id,Target
0,0
1,0.5
2,1
```","# Dataset Description

