# Evaluation

## Macro-F1

The macro-averaged F1 score (or macro F1 score) is computed by taking the arithmetic mean (aka unweighted mean) of all the per-class F1 scores. This method treats all classes equally regardless of their support values aka does not take label imbalance into account.","# Dataset Description

