# Description

The following elements define the structure of the dataset:

* **images:** Folder with all the images used for this competition. There is a folder for train and test purposes. A reminder, these images are a four-time reduction of the original image of Unsplash.
* **train.csv**: Training set defined by a CSV file with the mapping between the images (defined by Id) and the Interest score. The images location are ./images/train/{Id}.jpg.
* **test.csv**: Testing set defined by a CSV file with the mapping between the images (defined by Id).The images location are ./images/test/{Id}.jpg.
* **sample_submission.csv**: an example in a CSV file of the format of a submission for the competition (defined with Id an identifier and Interest the score to predict)",False,True
