...
```

An example submission is provided on the data page.","# Dataset Description

# Directory Structure
- train
  - The image files for the training set
- train.csv
  - The labels for the training set
- test
  - The image files for the test set
- submission_sample.csv
  - The sample of submission file

---

The evaluation metric for this competition is Accuracy.

## Submission Format

submission files should contain two columns: `file_path` and `label`. A header will be needed for the submission, so the first line will start with the header information.


The file header **must** contain a header. Details can be found on Overview/Evaluation page.",False,True
