### Aspectos a Considerar
- Se evaluar¨¢ su habilidad para programar en Python (el uso de PySpark es un plus en la evaluaci¨®n), implementaci¨®n de buenas pr¨¢cticas en ingenier¨ªa de datos, desarrollo e implementaci¨®n de modelos, documentaci¨®n, an¨¢lisis de datos y presentaci¨®n de resultados.
- La calificaci¨®n seg¨²n el ranking se tendr¨¢ en cuenta con el private leaderboard para aquellos participantes que superen el clasificador aleatorio, en caso contrario la calificaci¨®n sera de 0.

# Entregable
Como se menciona previamente, se espera que se suban las submissions directamente a Kaggle y con ello obtengan su puntaje parcial en el Leaderboard. De igual forma se sube un archivo de ejemplo llamado sample.csv que permite corroborar el tipo de archivo (csv) y el formato en que se deben subir las predicciones a Kaggle. **Es necesario presentar el c¨®digo fuente y la presentaci¨®n.**","# Dataset Description

Informacion de las variables

# Financial and Demographic
1. Edad (numeric)
2. Tipo_Trabajo : type of job (categorical: 'admin.','blue-collar','entrepreneur','housemaid','management','retired','self-employed','services','student','technician','unemployed','unknown')
3. Estado_Civil : marital status (categorical: 'divorced','married','single','unknown'; note: 'divorced' means divorced or widowed)
4. Educacion (categorical: 'basic.4y','basic.6y','basic.9y','high.school','illiterate','professional.course','university.degree','unknown')
5. Incumplimiento: has credit in default? (categorical: 'no','yes','unknown')
6. Vivienda: has housing loan? (categorical: 'no','yes','unknown')
7. Consumo: has personal loan? (categorical: 'no','yes','unknown')

# Related with the last contact of the current campaign:
8. Contacto: contact communication type (categorical: 'cellular','telephone') 
9. Mes: last contact month of year (categorical: 'jan', 'feb', 'mar', ..., 'nov', 'dec')
10. Dia: last contact day of the week (categorical: 'mon','tue','wed','thu','fri')
11. Campana: number of contacts performed during this campaign and for this client (numeric, includes last contact)
12. Dias_Ultima_Cam: number of days that passed by after the client was last contacted from a previous campaign (numeric; 999 means client was not previously contacted)
13. No_Contactos: number of contacts performed before this campaign and for this client (numeric)
14. Resultado_Anterior: outcome of the previous marketing campaign (categorical: 'failure','nonexistent','success')

# Social and Economic context attributes
15. emp_var_rate: employment variation rate - quarterly indicator (numeric)
16. cons_price_idx: consumer price index - monthly indicator (numeric) 
17. cons_conf_idx: consumer confidence index - monthly indicator (numeric) 
18. euribor3m: euribor 3 month rate - daily indicator (numeric)
19. nr_employed: number of employees - quarterly indicator (numeric)

# Output variable (desired target):
20. y - has the client subscribed a term deposit? (binary: 'yes = 1','no = 0')",False,True
