Precision is the ratio of true positives \(\text{tp}\) to all predicted positives \(\text{tp} + \text{fp}\). Recall is the ratio of true positives \(\text{tp}\) to all actual positives \(\text{tp} + \text{fn}\). The F1 score is given by:","# Dataset Description

