Chair IEEE Geo Science & Remote Sensing Society WNY
Chair IEEE GRSS 2022 [UAV STRATUS Conference](https://stratus-conference.com/)
[Digital Imaging and Remote Sensing Laboratory](https://www.rit.edu/dirs/)
[Chester F. Carlson Center for Imaging Science](https://www.rit.edu/science/chester-f-carlson-center-imaging-science)
