6020,mllab-summer-training-2,"# Description

1. Introduce
   This is the Kaggle competition for HW2 in Summer training.

   Given the title and the content of the news, you need to train a model to correctly classify the news into 4 different 
   categories:

   - World
   - Sports
   - Business
   - Sci/Tech

2. Upload
You need to upload the result file for the submission
For details of the format, please check the Evaluation and Data

3. Rules
Only one person as a team
You can submit the answer 10 times every 24 hours
Do not share your result with your classmate

4. Criteria
You need to surpass the baseline.
If you have any questions or need help, feel free to ask.
----------------------
# Evaluation

# Submission Format
Submission files should contain only one column: Category (World, Sports, Business, Sci/Tech)

The file should contain a header and have the same format as [sample_submission.csv](https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/mllab-summer-training-2/data?select=sample_submission.csv)","# Dataset Description

### File Description
train.csv - training set

test.csv - testing set for the leaderboard ranking and final scoring

sample_submission.csv - the sample submission file in the correct format

### Data Fields
Id - an anonymous id unique to a given news title

Category - the label category of the news title

Title - the title of the news

