- test.csv: very similar in structure to train.csv. Except that there is an incomplete field (29 cards) to use to make the recommendation.

Some general information to have in mind:

- the test set is the last week of decks produced, so the split is temporal
- the deck should be composed of 30 cards and with a maximum of two times the same card in it 
- some cards are linked to specific hero
- the setup is the user owns all the cards",False,True
