## Overview
The data for this competition has been split into two groups:

- training set (train.csv)
- test set (test.csv)

The training set should be used to build the machine learning model. For the training set, we provide the rent for each accommodation along with 35 other features.

The test set should be used to see how the model performs on unseen data. Thus, the rent for each accommodation is is not provided. The purpose of the model is to predict these values.

To illustrate the format of a submission file, we have provided **sample_submission.csv**

## Files

*   **train.csv** - the training set
*   **test.csv** - the test set
*   **sample_submission.csv** - a sample submission file in the correct format

## Data Dictionary
|  Variable | Definition |
| ---  | --- |
| title | Name of the accommodation |
| city | City |
| postalCode | Postal Code |
| latitude | Latitude in degrees |
| longitude | Longitude in degrees |
| areaSqm | Size in square meters |
| firstSeenAt | Registration time of the proprietor (YYYY-MM-DD HH-MM-SS) GMT |
| lastSeenAt | Latest appearance of the proprietor (YYYY-MM-DD HH-MM-SS) GMT |
| isRoomActive | Current Availability |
| rawAvailability | Time period of availability (DD-MM-YYYY) |
| postedago | How long ago the property was posed |
| descriptionNonTranslated | Original description |
| descriptionTranslated	 | Translated Description   |
| rentDetail	 |  Justification of rent  |
| propertyType	 |  Type of accommodation  |
| furnish	 | Presence of furniture |
| energyLabel	 |  Energy Efficiency  |
| gender	 | Proprietor's gender |
| internet	 |  Availability of Internet  |
| roommates	 |  # of roommates  |
| shower	 |  Ownership of shower  |
| toilet	 | Ownership of toilet |
| kitchen	 | Ownership of kitchen |
| living	 |  Ownership of living room  |
| pets	 | Pets allowed  |
| smokingInside	 |  Smoking allowed  |
| matchAge	 |  Desired tenant age (Range in years)  |
| matchGender	 |  Desired tenant gender  |
| matchCapacity	 | # of people that can live in the accommodation  |
| matchLanguages	 |  Desired language  |
| matchStatus	 |  Desired Status |
| coverImageUrl	 | Url of the covering image of the accommodation |
| rent	 |  Rent  (goal feature) |",False,True
