# **Welcome to the NeuroML2022 Homework 1**
Hi, students of Skoltech's NeuroML2022 course!

In the homework you have to predict probability of fist motion on EEG record

# **Evaluation**
Your metric will be ROC-AUC

# **Target**
You have to prepare target column yourself. Look for condition field in train/test dataset. 1 is resting state (expected = 0), 2 and 3 are hand motions. (expected = 1)

# **Examples**
See our github https://github.com/adasegroup/NEUROML2022/blob/main/seminar1/hw1-baseline.ipynb

