The test.csv file contains the filenames of the test files.

You are requested to perform any data preprocessing tasks in case of discrepancies in the data.

## Files

*   **train_data** - the training set images
*   **test_data** - the test set images
*   **test.csv** - the test set
*   **sample_submission.csv** - a sample submission file in the correct format",False,True
