https://www.kaggle.com/kuantinglai/taiwanese-food-101

There are 20,372 training images and 5,093 test images.

This homework may consume significant GPU time. Please watch out your Kaggle free quota. Turn off the GPU if you are not doing training.","# Dataset Description

