   </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
   <td>Dig
   </td>
   <td>5 power (2 rubble removed, 2 resources gain, 10 lichen value removed)
   </td>
   <td>100 power (20 rubble removed, 20 resource gain, 100 lichen value removed)
   </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
