6281,vehicle-loan-defaulter-tfug-delhi-challenge-1-2022,"# Description

# Welcome to the TFUG x Kaggle Campaign by TFUG Delhi
TFUG x Kaggle Campaign is TFUG-organized Kaggle competitions to increase awareness of implementation of Machine Learning in solving real world problem. It is aimed at helping community members collaborate, practice and learn Machine Learning and Data Science skills together. 

At the end day of the competition, we will organise a Meetup for all the teams to network and present their solutions. You do not need to attend this event to be a part of the competition. But do join to collaborate, learn and teach others.
Meetup Link: [TFUG Delhi x Kaggle - Show and Tell](https://www.meetup.com/tfugdelhi/events/289477928)
----------------------
# Evaluation

We selected the Classification Accuracy metric for this challenge. 

![# of correct predictions / total predictions](https://miro.medium.com/max/373/1*yRa2inzTnyASJOre93ep3g.gif)

Check out sample_submission.csv for submission format. Let us know if there are any issues.
----------------------
# Prizes

The top teams will win Google Cloud credits worth $100.
----------------------
# Acknowledgements & Disclaimer

The dataset provided in this competition is a synthetic dataset created from a modified version of L&T Vehicle Loan Default Prediction Dataset from Mamta Dhaker. This dataset was created for educational purpose only.","# Dataset Description

Predict wether an applicant, if granted a loan, will default on his EMI payment. This data is synthetically generated from CTGAN by using and modifying the L&T Vehicle Loan Default Prediction dataset. Although we have scanned the data to make sure there are no issues, some anomalies might have crept in. Brownie points to candidates who detect such instances.

## Files

*   **train.csv** - the training set
*   **test.csv** - the test set
*   **sample_submission.csv** - a sample submission file in the correct format

## Columns

*   `unique_id` - Unique Identifier for applicant
*   `loan_amount`?- Amount of loan to be received by applicant from the Bank
*   `loan_manager_id`?- Unique identifier for Loan Manager at the Bank
*   `asset_cost`?- Cost of the Scooter, Car, Van, etc.
*   `loan_to_asset_value_ratio`?- Ratio of Loan Disbursed to Market Value of the Asset
*   `asset_manufacturer_id`?- Unique identifier for vehicle manufacture like Tata
*   `applicant_age`
*   `area_code`?- Unique identifier for address. Not exactly PIN code.
*   `employment_type`?- Salaried v/s Self-employed
*   `mobile_no_available`
*   `aadhaar_available`
*   `pan_available`
*   `voter_id_available`
*   `driving_licence_available`
*   `passport_available`
*   `credit_score`?- CIBIL Score for credit worthiness
*   `new_loan_accounts_in_last_6_months`?- Loans taken by the applicant recently. 
*   `overdue_accounts_in_last_6_months`?- Loans defaulted by applicant recently.
*   `avg_account_age`?- Average tenure of credit instruments in applicant's profile 
*   `credit_history_length`?- Time since purchase of first credit instrument
*   `no_of_inquiries_in_last_month`?- Recent enquires done by applicant for a credit instrument.
*   `no_of_loan_accounts`?- Count of total loans. It can be in their name or where they are a co-applicant or guarantor. 
*   `active_loan_accounts`?- Count of active loans. It can be in their name or where they are a co-applicant or guarantor. 
*   `overdue_accounts`?- Count of loan accounts that are overdue. It can be in the applicant's name or where they are a co-applicant or guarantor. 
*   `existing_loan_balance`?- Amount of loan left. It can be in their name or where they are a co-applicant or guarantor. 
*   `total_disbursed_amount`?- Total amount of total loans taken by the applicant. It can be in their name or where they are a co-applicant or guarantor. 
*   `current_installment`?- Total current EMI payable by the applicant for his active loans.
*   `loan_defaulted`",False,True
