# House Of Developers

# House Of Developers 
## About
House of Developers is a 48-hour mega hackathon hosted by GDSC VIT Chennai in partnership with the Fraternity of Young Innovators to help aspiring engineers advance their skills.
The domains involved are:

*Blockchain*, where programmers foster innovations using cutting-edge blockchain technologies. On top of a blockchain ecosystem, the goal is to build a sample application. This will help participants understand various new aspects of a new technology, from ideation to execution.

*Data science* deals with building a method for extracting business-focused insights from data. This requires an understanding of how value and information flow in a business and the ability to use that understanding to identify business opportunities.

*UlUX Design* bring together designers, developers, and other front-end professionals to come up with innovative solutions to common user interface problems. Participants will be working on themes to design of any user interfaces.

