You will be given a directory called `train` which has another directory called `uploads`. The train dataset is split into 50 folds, you will have to concatenate all of them to train.

### Test
You are given a `test.csv` directory which contains the `test.csv` file.

## Column Names
- `machine_id` - An ID to distinguish between different machines
- `security_product_name` - Antivirus installed in the machine
