6323,prediction-challenge-r-bribe-amount-regression,"# Description

This is a dataset from the World Bank and other resources. The data can be used to examine whether transparency enhancing information technologies make a firm vulnerable to harassment (e.g., tax audits) by corrupt public officials in emerging markets.

In this competition, students would predict the amount of bribes paid by the firms in the sample.
