This is a (simplified) dataset. Your focus will be to predict the bribes (""BribeValue"") paid by the firms in the validation dataset. You'll use the training dataset for developing your prediction models.

**Files**

- training_data-reg.csv - the training dataset with the target value (""BribeValue"") included for training your prediction models.
- validation_data.csv - the dataset for which you'll provide predicted value of bribes.
- SampleSub-reg.csv - a sample submission file in the correct format for your reference. The predicted bribe values are 100 by default -- you'll replace that with your predicted values corresponding to the firms (""idstd"") in the validation dataset.
- WorldBankSurvey.pdf - supplemental document with a version of the survey used by the World Bank",False,True
