  **Answer:**  WiDS Datathon teams are formed on Kaggle. Teams are open to individuals or teams of up to 4; at least half of each team must be individuals who identify as women. Each team member must be officially [registered for the WiDS Datathon](https://airtable.com/shrSmOC8mMDjc4dFl). You may merge with / combine teams until February 26th. Once you join a team on Kaggle, you cannot remove yourself from the team.<br><br>

