# **Welcome to the TFUG x Kaggle Campaign by TFUG Delhi**
TFUG x Kaggle Campaign is TFUG-organized Kaggle competitions to increase awareness of implementation of Machine Learning in solving real world problem. It is aimed at helping community members collaborate, practice and learn Machine Learning and Data Science skills together. **There is no restriction on the programming language or framework you can use.**

Do join the offline meetup if you are in NCR. [Event](https://www.meetup.com/pydelhi/events/290327336/) This event will not affect your position on Leaderboard but people attending will get a chance to win some goodies from our side. Do join to collaborate, learn and teach others.

We also have the following as our **Event Partner**:

![StyavaDev](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-user-content/o/inbox%2F598746%2F4361bac6b3047c2da46436b6f6517ae5%2FStyavaDev.png?generation=1669232329973309&alt=media)

----------------------
# Evaluation

We selected the F{Beta}Score metric for this challenge with Beta = 2. 

![Weighted harmonic mean of recall and precision](https://i0.wp.com/neptune.ai/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/fbeta_eq.png?ssl=1)

Check out this discussion for more insights: [StackExchange DataScience Question 16179](https://datascience.stackexchange.com/questions/16179/what-is-the-correct-way-to-compute-mean-f1-score)

Check out sample_submission.csv for submission format. Let us know if there are any issues.
