We have a set of data collected from indoor cats equipped with an accelerometer device called Fitbark.  This was worn by the cats for at least a month.  The data are composed of descriptive demographic characteristics such as breed and the recorded activity data.  The Fitbark device puts out a health index (healthy or unhealthy) calibrated against pet cats ¨C this is the target variable for this study.

## Files

*   **train.csv** - the training set
*   **test.csv** - the test set
*   **sample_submission.csv** - a sample submission file in the correct format

