[Measuring Perceptual Color Differences of Smartphone Photography](https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.13489)
This competition contains 10000 training pairs, 20000 testing pairs. The test set is split evenly into the public and private leaderboard.
Good luck and have fun!","# Dataset Description

