<p>If your problem persists or it seems to be effective all participants then please <a href=""https://www.kaggle.com/contact"" target=""_blank"">contact us</a>.</p>","# Dataset Description

<h3>Overview</h3>
<p>The data has been split into two groups:</p>
<ul>
<li>training set (train.csv)</li>
