6766,kaggle-pog-series-s01e04,"# Description

Help me improve my sleep!

I am providing 8 years of sleep and health data in this compeition. Try to predict my sleep patterns since 2022 using historic data. By entering you have a chance to win one of TWO GPUS.

SIGN UP FOR GTC 2023 FOR A CHANCE TO WIN USING THIS LINK: https://nvda.ws/3wnl2yb

# Welcome
Welcome to the fourth competition in the PogChamp series. This series is designed to help new data scientists grow in their knowledge and understanding of machine learning concepts. All are welcome, but viewers of the data science twitch community are especially encouraged to participate. We encourage you to watch Rob's live streams on his youtube and twitch channel many Tuesday, Thursday and Sundays 8:30PM-11:30 EST. This competition and much more will be discussed!

Winners have the chance to be eligible for some awesome prizes! You must sign up and attend a GTC session in order to be eligible. Sign up using this link:  https://nvda.ws/3wnl2yb

# Prizes and Details

The top placing teams will be eligible to win prizes, provided that they meet the submission requirements.

<img title=""a title"" alt=""Alt text"" src=""https://m.media-amazon.com/images/W/IMAGERENDERING_521856-T1/images/I/71m9FJCubXL.jpg""  width=""500"">

- **First Place**: NVIDIA RTX 4080 Ti GPU
