----------------------
# Evaluation

You will be evaluated using Root Mean Squared Error between your predicted hours of sleep and my actual sleep for a night on a given day (Noon-Noon)

$$rmse = \sqrt{(\frac{1}{n})\sum_{i=1}^{n}(y_{i} - x_{i})^{2}}$$","# Dataset Description

# The Data

In this competition I am providing 8 years of historic health data taken from various devices including: Fitbit, Apple Watch and iPhone.

You are tasked with using this data to predict my sleep paterns since 2022.

## train.csv
Historic Data with the rollup sleep hours for prior years:
