Save the resultant file in the CSV format and submit it. Make sure the column names follow the uppercase and lowercase format and are exactly ID and Price. See the example in the Description section. 

Your submission will be immediately scored on a fraction of the diamonds according to the Mean Absolute Percentage Error (MAPE) metric that we will discuss in class. The lower, the better.","# Dataset Description

