For python users who want a tutorial on using notebooks, feel free to get started in Jupyter Notebook or Kaggle Notebooks (an interactive online editor) by copying and editing [this template](https://www.kaggle.com/code/stonet2000/lux-ai-challenge-season-2-tutorial-python).

